# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: kinds in a group body only: no message kind. Public.
format     conformance-held-items
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.recs  count 8
  kind   a
  when   8  1
  field  probe.x  8  uint
end
